  "text": "��态変更された方を確認しよう\n\n.OutputStreamにファイルを保存する具体例を確かめましょう。ここでは静的ファイルを読み込んで、それをOutputStreamに保存します。この処理は `KV_FIFO_READ` を実行する際に使用されます。\n\n```java\n// KV_FIFO_READ を実行する\nnewAssignedKvDiskSearch.handleTimeout(-1);\n\n// dataへ読み込んでデータアウトプットストリームへ保存\nDiskResult<AssignedKvDiskSearch> diskSearchResult = assignedKvDiskSearch.handleTimeout(-1);\nByteBuffer classifierResult = assignedKvClassifier.handleTimeout(-1);\n\nfinal KvWithDataIncomes byteIncomes;\nBST<Long,ExternalData> conditionProfiles =\n    assignedKvClassifier.getClassifierDisk().getClassifier(conditionProfileFilters);\nKvTagSearch upstreamTag = assignedKvTagSearch.getTag(true);\n\n{\n    InputStream byteInstream = assignedKvSearchCondition.getTagByteInstream(upstreamTag, conditionProfiles);\n    byteIncomes = new AssignedKvIncomes(byteInstream);\n}\n\nLong dkst; // searchBytesLength;\n\n// 情形1\nSystem.out.println(featureImperative);\n\n{\n    // 4バイトのI2P adressテキスト読み込み\n    String binary_adress_text;\n    {\n        responseBody.setReadPosition(4);\n        byteInstream.read(binary_adress_text, 8);\n        AssetFileDescriptor ssoAssetFileDescriptor =\n            downloadedAssetFileDescriptors.get(responseBody.getReadPosition() - 4);\n        byteInstream.read(binary_adress_text, 8);\n        byte[] IP_bytes = new byte[] {};\n        if (ssoAssetFileDescriptor != null) {\n            ByteBuffer ssoByteBuffer = ByteBuffer.allocate(8);\n            AssetFileInputStream ssoByte = new AssetFileInputStream(ssoAssetFileDescriptor);\n            ssoByteBuffer = ByteToByteBufferUtil.writeByteBuffer(ssoByte, ssoByteBuffer);\n            IP_bytes = new byte[8];\n            for (int i = 0; i < 8; i++) {\n                IP_bytes[i] = new BigInteger(\n                    ssoByteBuffer.array()[i * 8 + 0]\n                        * 256 + ssoByteBuffer.array()[i * 8 + 1]\n                        * 256 + ssoByteBuffer.array()[i * 8 + 2]\n                        * 256 + ssoByteBuffer.array()[i * 8 + 3],\n               